<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lone Star, Outback Steakhouse cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lone Star, Outback Steakhouse cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said on Friday analyst Mike Fineman had cut his rating for Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon Inc to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Fineman also cut his rating for Outback Steakhouse Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Outback fell 4-5/8 to 19. Lone Star's fell 2-1/4 to 25-3/4.</p>
<p>(-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
